('area:tignes-val-disere','pass','line',20,'A week in either resort','{}'::text[],'review','loader','pass.scenarios.0.who'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','pass','line',21,'The only six day pass covers the whole area, at {{f:F000068}} for an adult and {{f:F000398}} for children of 8 to 18 and seniors of 65 to 74.',array['F000068','F000398']::text[],'review','loader','pass.scenarios.0.what'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','pass','line',22,'Families','{}'::text[],'review','loader','pass.scenarios.1.who'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','pass','line',23,'Children under 8 ski free, and four or more passes of six days or longer bought together, for two adults and at least two children, take {{f:F000410}} off the total.',array['F000410']::text[],'review','loader','pass.scenarios.1.what'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','pass','line',24,'Early and late season','{}'::text[],'review','loader','pass.scenarios.2.who'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','pass','line',25,'From {{f:F000404|dm}} to {{f:F000405|dm}} and from {{f:F000406|dm}} to {{f:F000407|dm}} a day on the whole area costs {{f:F000399}}; Tignes alone opens a week earlier, on {{f:F000383|dm}}.',array['F000383','F000399','F000404','F000405','F000406','F000407']::text[],'review','loader','pass.scenarios.2.what'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','pass','line',26,'Rest days','{}'::text[],'review','loader','pass.scenarios.3.who'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','pass','line',27,'Passes of six days or more include unlimited entry to Le Lagon in Tignes, and two entries to the Centre Aquasportif in Val d''Isère.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','pass.scenarios.3.what'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','pass','line',28,'A single day','{}'::text[],'review','loader','pass.scenarios.4.who'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','pass','line',29,'A day on one resort costs {{diff:F000067,F000400}} less than a day on the whole area.',array['F000067','F000400']::text[],'review','loader','pass.scenarios.4.what'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','pass','line',30,'Over 75','{}'::text[],'review','loader','pass.scenarios.5.who'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','pass','line',31,'Skiers aged 75 and over ride free, subject to the conditions at the ticket office.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','pass.scenarios.5.what'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','pass','note',1,'Adults are 19 to 64; children of 8 to 18 and seniors of 65 to 74 pay the reduced rate. High season runs from {{f:F000408|dm}} to {{f:F000409|dm}}.',array['F000408','F000409']::text[],'review','loader','pass.after'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','access','heading',0,'Getting there and choosing a base','{}'::text[],'review','loader','access.h2'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','access','para',0,'By the fastest road, Geneva airport is {{f:F000482}} from Les Brévières and {{f:F000483}} from Le Fornet, Lyon airport {{f:F000484|n}} to {{f:F000485}} and Chambéry {{f:F000486|n}} to {{f:F000487}}. Every route climbs from Bourg-Saint-Maurice on the D902 past the Chevril dam, and the Col de l''Iseran beyond Val d''Isère is closed to traffic in winter, so there is no way in from the Maurienne.',array['F000482','F000483','F000484','F000485','F000486','F000487']::text[],'review','loader','access.paras.0'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','access','para',1,'Bourg-Saint-Maurice is the railway station, {{f:F000488|n}} to {{f:F000489}} from the villages by road, and the Eurostar ski service from London calls there on winter Saturdays. Regional buses run from the station to both resorts, and some long distance coaches stop at La Daille, where free shuttles run to the centre of Val d''Isère.',array['F000488','F000489']::text[],'review','loader','access.paras.1'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','access','note',0,'Road distances are the fastest route by the OSRM router on OpenStreetMap data, without traffic or snow. The ski train as reported by <a href="https://www.seat61.com/trains-and-routes/eurostar-ski-train.htm">Seat 61</a>; roads and buses by <a href="https://guide-ski.fr/?p=450">Guide Ski</a>. 2026/27 bus timetables have not yet been checked.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','access.accessNote'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','access','heading',1,'How far each base reaches','{}'::text[],'review','loader','access.basesH3'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','access','para',2,'Tignes Le Lac and Val Claret are the best placed bases. From Val Claret, Val d''Isère is {{f:F000449|w}} lift rides away and a lift top above 3,000 m only {{f:F000451|w}}, by the Perce-Neige funicular. From the village of Val d''Isère, Tignes Le Lac is {{f:F000456|w}} lift rides away.',array['F000449','F000451','F000456']::text[],'review','loader','access.basesParas.0'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','access','para',3,'Les Brévières and Le Fornet pay for their quiet in lifts. From Les Brévières, Val d''Isère takes {{f:F000465|w}} lift rides and Le Fornet {{f:F000466|w}}; from Le Fornet, Tignes Le Lac takes {{f:F000468|w}}.',array['F000465','F000466','F000468']::text[],'review','loader','access.basesParas.1'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','access','caption',0,'Lift rides from each base','{}'::text[],'review','loader','access.basesCaption'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','access','line',0,'To Tignes Le Lac','{}'::text[],'review','loader','access.baseCols.0'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','access','line',1,'To Val d''Isère','{}'::text[],'review','loader','access.baseCols.1'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','access','line',2,'To Le Fornet','{}'::text[],'review','loader','access.baseCols.2'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','access','line',3,'To a lift top above 3,000 m','{}'::text[],'review','loader','access.baseCols.3'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','access','line',4,'Val Claret','{}'::text[],'review','loader','access.bases.0.base'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','access','line',5,'Tignes Le Lac','{}'::text[],'review','loader','access.bases.1.base'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','access','line',6,'Val d''Isère','{}'::text[],'review','loader','access.bases.2.base'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','access','line',7,'La Daille','{}'::text[],'review','loader','access.bases.3.base'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','access','line',8,'Les Brévières','{}'::text[],'review','loader','access.bases.4.base'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','access','line',9,'Le Fornet','{}'::text[],'review','loader','access.bases.5.base'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','access','note',1,'Fewest lift rides from the village lifts before reaching the first lift of each area, on the OpenStreetMap model, counting the Perce-Neige and Funival funiculars as lifts and the walk along the Val Claret snow front. Times are not included.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','access.basesNote'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','snowboard','kicker',0,'Snowboarders','{}'::text[],'review','loader','chapters.0.kicker'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','snowboard','heading',0,'Riding Tignes Val d''Isère on a board','{}'::text[],'review','loader','chapters.0.h2'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','snowboard','para',0,'Each resort keeps its own park. Tignes has its snowpark at the top of the Grattalu chair above Val Claret, with kickers, rails and boxes for beginners and intermediates and a free airbag, a halfpipe at the foot of the Lanches chair, and an expert boardercross in the same Palet sector. Val d''Isère''s Val Park fills the middle of the Bellevarde bowl below the Mont Blanc chair, with kickers graded from green to black.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','chapters.0.paras.0'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','snowboard','para',1,'Drag lifts are scarce in the villages and common on the glacier. In the map data {{f:F000413}} of the {{f:F000412}} main lifts are drags; they make up {{f:F000431}} of the main lifts on the Grande Motte and {{f:F000447}} in Le Fornet, against {{f:F000427}} in Val Claret.',array['F000412','F000413','F000427','F000431','F000447']::text[],'review','loader','chapters.0.paras.1'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','snowboard','para',2,'Away from the parks, terrain beyond the markers is not controlled, so the avalanche bulletin and a local guide come first.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','chapters.0.paras.2'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','snowboard','heading',1,'Parks and places to ride','{}'::text[],'review','loader','chapters.0.listTitle'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','snowboard','note',0,'Parks: <a href="https://seetignes.com/ski-area/snowparks">See Tignes</a> (October 2024) and <a href="https://guide-ski.fr/?p=170">Guide Ski</a>. Drag lift shares from OpenStreetMap. Park layouts change every season.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','chapters.0.note'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','families','kicker',0,'Families','{}'::text[],'review','loader','chapters.1.kicker'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','families','heading',0,'Holidays with children','{}'::text[],'review','loader','chapters.1.h2'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','families','para',0,'Tignes and Val d''Isère both carry the Famille Plus label for family resorts, and the pass is generous to the young: children under 8 ski free, and a family buying four week passes together saves {{f:F000410}} on the total.',array['F000410']::text[],'review','loader','chapters.1.paras.0'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','families','para',1,'Tignes makes the first days easy. Free beginner lifts run at Le Lac, Le Lavachet and Val Claret, the Bollin chair at Val Claret is free, and four free sledging areas sit at Le Lac, Le Lavachet, Tignes 1800 and Les Brévières. The Expédition Cobra snow luge runs about {{f:F000394}} down from Palafour and is not recommended for children under 13, and passes of six days or more include unlimited entry to the Lagon pool.',array['F000394']::text[],'review','loader','chapters.1.paras.1'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','families','para',2,'Val d''Isère has a free drag to the green Savonnette run at the foot of the main snow front, Ski Tranquille slow zones at Solaise and Bellevarde, a snow garden for the youngest, and the Centre Aquasportif with a sports pool and a leisure pool. Free shuttles link La Daille, Le Fornet and Legettaz to the centre.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','chapters.1.paras.2'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','families','para',3,'For a base, Tignes Le Lac has the highest share of green and blue in the map data, {{f:F000422}}, and sits one lift ride from Val Claret, La Daille and Les Brévières.',array['F000422']::text[],'review','loader','chapters.1.paras.3'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','families','heading',1,'For children','{}'::text[],'review','loader','chapters.1.listTitle'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','families','note',0,'Sources: <a href="https://www.france.fr/fr/article/label-ski-famille-plus/">France.fr on Famille Plus</a> (updated October 2023), <a href="https://guide-ski.fr/?p=170">Guide Ski for Tignes</a> and <a href="https://guide-ski.fr/?p=450">for Val d''Isère</a>. Ages and opening times are best checked when booking.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','chapters.1.note'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','food','kicker',0,'Food','{}'::text[],'review','loader','chapters.2.kicker'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','food','heading',0,'Eating on the mountain','{}'::text[],'review','loader','chapters.2.h2'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','food','para',0,'Each resort has one Michelin star in the 2026 guide: Ursus in Tignes, where Clément Bouvier cooks, and La Table de l''Ours in Val d''Isère, Antoine Gras''s restaurant in the Barmes de l''Ours hotel.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','chapters.2.paras.0'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','food','para',1,'On the Val d''Isère side, Le Signal at the top of the Le Fornet cable car has a sun terrace, a log fire and a yurt for cold days. La Peau de Vache, halfway down La Face, is known for burgers big enough for two, and Le Refuge de Solaise serves gourmet food in a glass conservatory below the top of the Solaise gondola. Down in the village, La Baraque on the main street has live folk music and a following among locals.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','chapters.2.paras.1'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','food','para',2,'In Tignes, L''Alpage des Chaudannes at the top of the Chaudannes chair, above Le Lac and Le Lavachet, serves Savoyard dishes and Savoie wines on a sun terrace. In Val Claret, La Taverne des Neiges by the Bollin and Fresse chairs looks up at the Grande Motte.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','chapters.2.paras.2'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','food','heading',1,'Tables worth the detour','{}'::text[],'review','loader','chapters.2.listTitle'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','food','note',0,'Michelin 2026: <a href="https://presse.explore-savoie.com/les-tables-distinguees-2026/">Savoie tourism</a>. Restaurants: <a href="https://snowcarbon.co.uk/ski-resorts/val-disere/restaurants-apres-ski-nightlife">Snowcarbon</a> for Val d''Isère and <a href="https://www.seetignes.com/restaurants/mountain/">See Tignes</a> for Tignes. Restaurants change hands and menus each season.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','chapters.2.note'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','apres','kicker',0,'Après','{}'::text[],'review','loader','chapters.3.kicker'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','apres','heading',0,'Après and evenings','{}'::text[],'review','loader','chapters.3.h2'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','apres','para',0,'La Folie Douce on the Daille gondola above La Daille was opened by Luc Reversade in {{f:F000395}}, and once enlarged it is credited with inventing open air après clubbing. Its afternoons run to live bands, DJs and cabaret until the lifts close.',array['F000395']::text[],'review','loader','chapters.3.paras.0'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','apres','para',1,'In Val d''Isère, Cocorico beside the main lift by the bus turning circle keeps the afternoon going, with La Doudoune in its basement open until five in the morning, and Dick''s Tea Bar in the centre, opened in {{f:F000396}}, takes over late at night.',array['F000396']::text[],'review','loader','chapters.3.paras.1'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','apres','para',2,'Tignes spreads its evenings between Le Lac and Val Claret. The Loop Bar at Le Lac can be skied to from the Trolles slope, and Strike, in the old bowling alley, claims to be the largest club in the Alps. In Val Claret, the Drop Zone has the biggest south facing terrace in Tignes by Iglu Ski''s account, and the Melting Pot stays open until four in the morning.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','chapters.3.paras.2'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','apres','heading',1,'Where the evenings start','{}'::text[],'review','loader','chapters.3.listTitle'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','apres','note',0,'Sources: <a href="https://www.mon-sejour-en-montagne.com/histoires-et-anecdotes/la-folie-douce-a-val-d-isere-ce-restaurant-d-altitude-devenu-le-haut-lieu-de-la-fete-sur-les-pistes/">Mon séjour en montagne on La Folie Douce</a> (September 2023), <a href="https://snowcarbon.co.uk/ski-resorts/val-disere/restaurants-apres-ski-nightlife">Snowcarbon</a> and <a href="https://www.aluxurytravelblog.com/2021/11/25/apres-ski-bars-in-val-disere/">A Luxury Travel Blog</a> (2021) for Val d''Isère, and <a href="https://www.igluski.com/blog/post/best-apres-ski-bars-and-nightlife-hotspots-in-tignes">Iglu Ski</a> for Tignes. Bars open and close from season to season.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','chapters.3.note'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','heading',0,'Who it suits','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.h2'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',0,'How the area suits different kinds of trip, on the evidence gathered so far.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.intro'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',1,'Exploring a large network','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.0.who'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',2,'Good fit','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.0.fit'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',3,'Two resorts linked by several lifts over one ridge, with no single closure that cuts them apart.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.0.why'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',4,'Les Brévières to Le Fornet takes {{m:all.brevieres.le-fornet|w}} lift rides each way.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.0.limit'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',5,'Intermediates who want variety','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.1.who'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',6,'Good fit','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.1.fit'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',7,'Green and blue reach every sector in the map data, and the centres of the two resorts are close on easy runs.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.1.why'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',8,'Solaise and Le Fornet are a long way round on green and blue.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.1.limit'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',9,'Groups of mixed ability','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.2.who'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',10,'Mixed','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.2.fit'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',11,'Val Claret and La Daille are one lift ride apart, so a group can split across the ridge and meet again.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.2.why'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',12,'The quickest ways back into Tignes Le Lac use black runs.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.2.limit'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',13,'First timers','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.3.who'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',14,'Good fit','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.3.fit'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',15,'Free beginner lifts in Tignes, a free drag to a green run in Val d''Isère, and children under 8 ski free.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.3.why'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',16,'Neither resort sells a week pass of its own, so a first week pays for the whole area.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.3.limit'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',17,'Families','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.4.who'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',18,'Good fit','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.4.fit'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',19,'Famille Plus in both resorts, a family discount on week passes and pool entry included.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.4.why'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',20,'Prices for lessons and childcare vary by village and are best checked when booking.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.4.limit'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',21,'Snowboarders','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.5.who'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',22,'Good fit','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.5.fit'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',23,'A snowpark, a halfpipe and a boardercross in Tignes, and Val Park on Bellevarde.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.5.why'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',24,'Drags make up {{f:F000431}} of the main lifts on the glacier.',array['F000431']::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.5.limit'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',25,'Experts','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.6.who'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',26,'Good fit','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.6.fit'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',27,'{{f:F000378}} black runs, the Face de Bellevarde and the highest difficult share of the Savoie areas on this site.',array['F000378']::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.6.why'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',28,'Off piste terrain is not controlled; the avalanche bulletin and a guide come first.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.6.limit'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',29,'Putting snow first','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.7.who'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',30,'Good fit','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.7.fit'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',31,'Tignes Le Lac and Val Claret start at {{f:F000420}} and {{f:F000424}}, and the season runs to {{f:F000385|dm}}.',array['F000385','F000420','F000424']::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.7.why'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',32,'At 1,600 m modelled snowfall has fallen, and four of the last five seasons were poor there.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.7.limit'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',33,'Travelling without a car','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.8.who'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',34,'Mixed','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.8.fit'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',35,'The ski train reaches Bourg-Saint-Maurice, with buses on to both resorts.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.8.why'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',36,'The last stretch is a bus ride up the valley, and 2026/27 timetables have not yet been checked.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.8.limit'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',37,'Preferring a smaller area','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.9.who'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',38,'Mixed','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.9.fit'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',39,'Day passes for Tignes or Val d''Isère alone.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.9.why'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',40,'There is no local week pass.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.9.limit'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',41,'Food lovers','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.10.who'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',42,'Good fit','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.10.fit'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',43,'A Michelin star in each resort and mountain tables from Le Fornet to the Chaudannes.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.10.why'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',44,'The best known tables are expensive and book up.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.10.limit'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',45,'Looking for après','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.11.who'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',46,'Good fit','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.11.fit'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',47,'The original Folie Douce, late clubs in both resorts and busy bars in Val Claret.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.11.why'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',48,'The two resorts are a bus ride apart in the evening.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.11.limit'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',49,'Non skiers','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.12.who'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',50,'Mixed','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.12.fit'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',51,'Pools in both resorts, sledging areas in Tignes and the snow luge.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.12.why'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',52,'Each activity is paid for separately unless it comes with a week pass.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.12.limit'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','heading',1,'The catches','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.catchesH3'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','fit','line',53,'The catches are price and the hard way home. The six day pass is the dearest of the four Savoie areas on this site, and neither resort offers a cheaper week of its own. The fewest lift rides back into Tignes Le Lac and Les Brévières from Val d''Isère use black runs, and Le Fornet hangs on a single chair. Lower down, the modelled snow has thinned, with four of the last five seasons at 1,600 m in the lowest third.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.catches'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','compare','heading',0,'The other large areas of Savoie','{}'::text[],'review','loader','compare.h2'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','compare','para',0,'Set against its neighbours, Tignes Val d''Isère is smaller than Les 3 Vallées and Paradiski, with {{f:F000080}} of piste against {{f:F000002}} and {{f:F000071}}, but it climbs highest, to {{f:F000083}}, and has the largest share of difficult piste, {{f:F000086}}.',array['F000002','F000071','F000080','F000083','F000086']::text[],'review','loader','compare.paras.0'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','compare','para',1,'Its day ticket matches Paradiski''s at {{f:F000067}}, but its six day pass is the dearest of the four at {{f:F000068}}. In the weather model it has the least snow of the four at 1,600 m, which matters less where Tignes Le Lac and Val Claret start at {{f:F000420}} and {{f:F000424}}.',array['F000067','F000068','F000420','F000424']::text[],'review','loader','compare.paras.1'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','compare','caption',0,'Four linked areas of Savoie','{}'::text[],'review','loader','compare.caption'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','compare','line',0,'Piste','{}'::text[],'review','loader','compare.rows.0.label'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','compare','line',1,'{{f:F000080}}',array['F000080']::text[],'review','loader','compare.rows.0.v.0'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','compare','line',2,'{{f:F000002}}',array['F000002']::text[],'review','loader','compare.rows.0.v.1'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','compare','line',3,'{{f:F000071}}',array['F000071']::text[],'review','loader','compare.rows.0.v.2'),
