('area:tignes-val-disere','method','heading',0,'Figures that do not agree','{}'::text[],'review','loader','method.conflictsH3'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','method','line',52,'Guide Ski''s Tignes page counts {{f:F000379}} lifts on the official sheet and its Val d''Isère page {{f:F000380}}, while skiresort.com lists {{f:F000081}}. The elevation model puts the top of the Grande Motte cable car at {{f:F000429}} against the published {{f:F000381}}. The mapped piste comes to {{f:F000415}}, against {{f:F000373}} from the operator. This page names each source alongside its figure.',array['F000081','F000373','F000379','F000380','F000381','F000415','F000429']::text[],'review','loader','method.conflicts'),
('area:tignes-val-disere','method','line',53,'Research of 24 October 2026. Size, runs, lifts, season dates, parks and passes: <a href="https://guide-ski.fr/?p=170">Guide Ski for Tignes</a> and <a href="https://guide-ski.fr/?p=450">for Val d''Isère</a>, and the <a href="https://www.tignes.co.uk/2026-2027-SkiPassPrices.pdf">2026/27 rate sheet</a>. Measured size and grades: <a href="https://www.skiresort.com/en/ski-resort/tignes-val-disere/">skiresort.com</a>. History: Wikipedia on <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tignes">Tignes</a> and <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Val-d%27Is%C3%A8re">Val d''Isère</a>. Network, bases, routes and lift heights: a graph of {{f:F000411}} lifts and {{f:F000414}} piste sections from <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright">OpenStreetMap</a> (© OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL), with heights from the Copernicus 90 m elevation model via <a href="https://open-meteo.com/en/docs/elevation-api">Open-Meteo</a>. Snowfall: ERA5 reanalysis via the <a href="https://open-meteo.com/en/docs/historical-weather-api">Open-Meteo historical weather API</a> (CC BY 4.0). Road distances: <a href="https://project-osrm.org/">OSRM</a>. Facts from operators, measurements, model results and estimates are kept apart in the research files, and conflicting figures are listed above rather than averaged.',array['F000411','F000414']::text[],'review','loader','method.sources');
